<speak>Certainly. We can discuss the preference today without treating the conversation as a completed profile update. Any formal administrative steps can be handled through the appropriate process at another time. For now, I will distinguish your preference from an actual change, so our notes do not blur the two. That also leaves you room to try a more consistent routine at home before deciding what suits you. There is no need to make every administrative decision in one sitting. You have already described the main practical issue clearly: keeping personal correspondence easy to find and separate from the business flow.</speak>